rface":"சேய","parts":[{"text":"சேய","lemma":"சேய்","gloss":"distant"}],"gloss":"distant"},{"surface":"ஆயினும்","parts":[{"text":"ஆயினும்","lemma":"ஆயினும்","gloss":"although"}],"gloss":"although"},{"surface":"தொடை","parts":[{"text":"தொடை","lemma":"தொடை","gloss":"stringing"}],"gloss":"stringing"},{"surface":"புணர்ந்து","parts":[{"text":"புணர்ந்து","lemma":"புணர்","gloss":"having joined"}],"gloss":"having joined"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அருவிலை","parts":[{"text":"அரு","lemma":"அரு","gloss":"rare"},{"text":"விலை","lemma":"விலை","gloss":"price"}],"gloss":"precious price"},{"surface":"நன்கலம்","parts":[{"text":"நன்கலம்","lemma":"நன்கலம்","gloss":"fine ornament"}],"gloss":"fine ornament","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"அமைக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"அமைக்கும்","lemma":"அமை","gloss":"fashioning"}],"gloss":"fashioning"},{"surface":"காலை","parts":[{"text":"காலை","lemma":"காலை","gloss":"time"}],"gloss":"at the time of"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஒருவழித்","parts":[{"text":"ஒருவழித்","lemma":"ஒருவழித்","gloss":"in one place"}],"gloss":"in one place","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோன்றியாங்கு","parts":[{"text":"தோன்றியாங்கு","lemma":"தோன்றியாங்கு","gloss":"just as they appear"}],"gloss":"just as they appear","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என்றும்","parts":[{"text":"என்றும்","lemma":"என்றும்","gloss":"always"}],"gloss":"always"},{"surface":"சான்றோர்","parts":[{"text":"சான்றோர்","lemma":"சான்றோர்","gloss":"noble people"}],"gloss":"noble people"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சான்றோர்","parts":[{"text":"சான்றோர்","lemma":"சான்றோர்","gloss":"noble people"}],"gloss":"noble people"},{"surface":"பாலர்","parts":[{"text":"பாலர்","lemma":"பால்","gloss":"on the side of"}],"gloss":"on the side of"},{"surface":"ஆப","parts":[{"text":"ஆப","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"they become"}],"gloss":"they become"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சாலார்","parts":[{"text":"சாலார்","lemma":"சாலார்","gloss":"ignoble people"}],"gloss":"ignoble people"},{"surface":"சாலார்","parts":[{"text":"சாலார்","lemma":"சாலார்","gloss":"ignoble people"}],"gloss":"ignoble people"},{"surface":"பாலர்","parts":[{"text":"பாலர்","lemma":"பால்","gloss":"on the side of"}],"gloss":"on the side of"},{"surface":"ஆகுபவே","parts":[{"text":"ஆகுப","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"they become"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"indeed they become"}]}],"literal":"Gold and, coral and, pearl and, enduring / great mountain yielded desirable gem and, / being separated by distance, though they are distant, stringing having joined, / precious-priced fine ornament at the time of fashioning, / in one place just as they appear, always noble people / noble people on the side of they become. / Ignoble people ignoble people on the side of indeed they become.","translation":"Gold, coral, pearls, and the desirable gems yielded by great mountains may originate in distant places, far apart from one another. Yet, when a precious, beautiful ornament is fashioned, they are brought together and strung in one place. In the same way, noble people will always seek out and join the company of other noble people. Those who lack nobility will likewise only join the company of their own kind.","modern":"பொன்னும், பவளமும், முத்துக்களும், சிறந்த மலைகள் தந்த அழகிய மணிகளும் தங்களுக்குள் பெருந்தொலைவு இடைவெளி கொண்டு வெவ்வேறு இடங்களில் தோன்றுவன ஆகும். ஆயினும், விலையுயர்ந்த நல்ல அணிகலன்களைச் செய்யும்போது, அவை அனைத்தும் ஒன்றாகக் கோக்கப்பட்டு ஒரே இடத்தில் விளங்குகின்றன. அதுபோலவே, சான்றோர்கள் எப்போதும் சான்றோர்களுடனேயே இணைவார்கள்; குணமற்ற தீயவர்கள் எப்போதும் குணமற்ற தீயவர்களுடனேயே இணைவார்கள்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Potuviyal tiṇai and is categorized under the theme of Kaiyaṟunilai, expressing grief and philosophical reflection on life. The poet Kaṇṇakaṉār uses a beautiful analogy of a precious ornament to explain human nature and relationships. Gold from the earth, coral from the deep ocean, pearls from the sea, and gems from high mountains all originate in vastly different, distant places. Yet, when a skilled artisan fashions a precious ornament, these diverse elements are brought together and united in one place. Similarly, noble and virtuous people (cāṉṟōr), regardless of where they are born or how far apart they live, will naturally find each other and unite. Conversely, those who lack nobility (cālār) will always gravitate toward their own kind.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,2.6],[2.6,2.7],[2.7,3.0],[3.0,3.5],[3.5,4.6],[4.6,4.6],[4.6,5.6],[5.6,5.8],[5.8,5.9],[5.9,7.3],[7.3,7.4],[7.4,7.9],[7.9,8.3],[8.3,9.63],[9.63,9.9],[9.9,10.6],[10.6,10.9],[10.9,11.7],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,12.3],[12.3,13.5],[13.5,13.6],[13.6,14.1],[14.1,14.5]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,0.7],[0.7,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.6,3.0],[3.0,3.2],[3.2,3.5],[3.5,4.0],[4.0,5.24],[5.24,5.4],[5.4,6.4],[6.4,6.7],[6.7,6.8],[6.8,8.3],[8.3,8.4],[8.4,9.0],[9.0,9.4],[9.4,10.84],[10.84,11.2],[11.2,12.0],[12.0,12.4],[12.4,13.5],[13.5,13.9],[13.9,14.1],[14.1,15.6],[15.6,15.6],[15.6,16.1],[16.1,16.6]]},"sync":[[["பொன்னும்","gold and"]],[["துகிரும்","coral and"]],[["முத்தும்","pearl and"]],[["மன்னிய","enduring"]],[["மாமலை","great mountain"]],[["பயந்த","yielded"]],[["காமரு","desirable"]],[["மணியும்","gem and"]],[["இடைபடச்","being separated"]],[["சேய","distant"]],[["ஆயினும்","although"]],[["தொடை","stringing"]],[["புணர்ந்து","having joined"]],[["அருவிலை","precious price"]],[["நன்கலம்","fine ornament"]],[["அமைக்கும்","fashioning"]],[["காலை","at the time of"]],[["ஒருவழித்","in one place"]],[["தோன்றியாங்கு","just as they appear"]],[["என்றும்","always"]],[["சான்றோர்","noble people"]],[["சான்றோர்","noble people"]],[["பாலர்","on the side of"]],[["ஆப","they become"]],[["சாலார்","ignoble people"]],[["சாலார்","ignoble people"]],[["பாலர்","on the side of"]],[["ஆகுபவே","indeed they become"]]]}